          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"setting-up-scrapling\">Setting Up Scrapling</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Scrapling is an adaptive web scraping library for Python. Follow the steps below to get it installed and ready to use.</span>\n<h2 id=\"1-prerequisites\">1. Prerequisites</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Python 3.9 or newer</li>\n<li><code>pip</code> (comes bundled with Python)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"2-create-a-virtual-environment-recommended\">2. Create a virtual environment (recommended)</h2>\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>python<span class=\"w\"> </span>-m<span class=\"w\"> </span>venv<span class=\"w\"> </span>scrapling-env\n<span class=\"nb\">source</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>scrapling-env/bin/activate<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"c1\"># macOS / Linux</span>\nscrapling-env<span class=\"se\">\\S</span>cripts<span class=\"se\">\\a</span>ctivate<span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"c1\"># Windows</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"3-install-scrapling\">3. Install Scrapling</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Basic installation:</span>\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>pip<span class=\"w\"> </span>install<span class=\"w\"> </span>scrapling\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">For the full feature set (Stealthy fetcher, Playwright support, adblocker, etc.):</span>\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>pip<span class=\"w\"> </span>install<span class=\"w\"> </span>scrapling<span class=\"o\">[</span>all<span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You can also install only what you need, for example:</span>\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>pip<span class=\"w\"> </span>install<span class=\"w\"> </span>scrapling<span class=\"o\">[</span>stealthy<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># Stealthy fetcher support</span>\npip<span class=\"w\"> </span>install<span class=\"w\"> </span>scrapling<span class=\"o\">[</span>playwright<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"c1\"># Playwright browser support</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"4-verify-the-installation\">4. Verify the installation</h2>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scrapling</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Fetcher</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Scrapling is ready!\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"5-first-use\">5. First use</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Fetch and parse a page with the adaptive engine:</span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scrapling</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Fetcher</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">page</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Fetcher</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"https://example.com\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">css</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"h1\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>      <span class=\"c1\"># CSS selectors</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">xpath</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"//h1\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># XPath also works</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You're all set \u2014 Scrapling is ready to use in your project.</span></span>"
          }
        }
